       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRIANGULAR-FORMULA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-N PIC 99.
       01 WS-T PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-N FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-N > 10
               COMPUTE WS-T = WS-N * (WS-N + 1) / 2
               DISPLAY WS-T
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
